# Rust plus BTF under LTO, without USE=rust. Fedora's config turns Rust on;
# up to 7.3.1 init/Kconfig dropped it on its own whenever BTF met LTO.
# CachyOS lifted that restriction in 7.3.3 ("rust: Allow BTF generation with
# Rust + LTO"), and the Rust modules it then builds (rnull_mod, ...) get no
# BTF from pahole --lang_exclude=rust, which fails resolve_btfids at
# modfinal. Every other combination keeps Fedora's Rust drivers.
# CONFIG_RUST is not set
